              "content": "APPROVED 门禁：必需要求 ACCEPTED|WAIVED；阻断检查 PASS；无 OPEN 命中；子案件全部 APPROVED；分类已确认；CRR 已评；four_eyes 时 decided_by ≠ recommended_by。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qZ2xf",
              "fill": "#1F2328",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "复审案件 APPROVED = 新决定续期（新 valid_to / next_review）；REJECTED = 资格 REVOKED → Client 自动 SUSPENDED（Q15）。任一进行中状态都可 → WITHDRAWN（图中只画 RETURNED 一条以保持清晰）。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
