    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "q0n9Jv",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 15600,
      "name": "12 AE 场景数据示例：Al Noor Trading FZ-LLC（迪拜 DMCC 自贸区）",
      "width": 2000,
      "fill": "#F6F5F1",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 28,
      "padding": 48,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "KjS9u",
          "fill": "#1F2328",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "AE 场景数据示例：Al Noor Trading FZ-LLC（迪拜 DMCC 自贸区公司，经 PayFac「Gulf Pay」入驻码 C2 接入）",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "QPAlV",
          "fill": "#5B6470",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "每张卡 = 一张表；卡内每个小块 = 一条记录（左列字段名，右列值）。上段：配置层（运营 DML 预置，所有 AE 商户共用）；中段：这家商户在 mor_client_master 的行；下段：它在 mor_compliance 的行。人物：Fatima Al Mansoori（阿联酋公民，股东 55%、UBO、General Manager、签字人）、Rahul Mehta（印度籍迪拜居民，股东 45%、UBO）。证件只显示 Token 与脱敏。与第 5 板沙特例子对照：差异全部在上段，中下两段的表与列完全相同。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "MTCwE",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
